      "name": "Oxide Return",
      "maker": "ARDENTI",
      "purpose": "A warm tape-style echo whose repeats saturate, darken and thin as they recirculate, with a gentle wow; time changes glide like a tape transport.",
      "description": "A warm tape-style echo whose repeats saturate, darken and thin as they recirculate, with a gentle wow; time changes glide like a tape transport. Shape the echo time, how long the repeats return, how much tape grit and wobble they gather and the low and high cut on the repeats; the dry signal stays clean. Switch to host-synced note values, cross the repeats between the sides, or speed the wobble up toward flutter when needed.",
      "role": "fx",
      "tags": [
        "delay",
        "tape",
        "warm"
      ]
    },
